===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|computing|GUI}} A [[graphical]] [[widget]] in the form of a [[horizontal]] or [[vertical]] bar, on the edges of a [[personal computer]] [[screen]], that is used to move [[scrollable]] [[text]] or [[image]]s.
# {{lb|en|hydrography}} A [[sandbar]] on the inside of a [[riverbend]].

